### Jungle Gaming — Distributed Wagering Processor HTTP Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@providerId = pragmatic-play

### 1. Health Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### 2. Health Readiness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 3. Prometheus Operational Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 4. Metrics in Structured JSON Format
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/json

### 5. Create a New Wallet (BRL)
# @name createWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "player-test-01",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "100.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Store walletId from creation response
@walletId = {{createWallet.response.body.id}}

### 6. Get Wallet by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}

### 7. Process BET (R$ 20,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Provider-Id: {{providerId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-round-101-1",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{providerId}}:round-101:bet-1",
  "playerId": "player-test-01",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-101",
  "gameId": "gates-of-olympus",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "20.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### 8. Idempotent Replay of BET (Same Key + Same Payload -> Replay 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Provider-Id: {{providerId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-round-101-1",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{providerId}}:round-101:bet-1",
  "playerId": "player-test-01",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-101",
  "gameId": "gates-of-olympus",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "20.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### 9. Process WIN (R$ 50,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Provider-Id: {{providerId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "win-round-101-1",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{providerId}}:round-101:win-1",
  "playerId": "player-test-01",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-101",
  "gameId": "gates-of-olympus",
  "kind": "WIN",
  "money": {
    "amount": "50.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### 10. Process REFUND for BET
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Provider-Id: {{providerId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "refund-round-101-1",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{providerId}}:round-101:refund-1",
  "playerId": "player-test-01",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-101",
  "gameId": "gates-of-olympus",
  "kind": "REFUND",
  "money": {
    "amount": "20.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  },
  "referenceExternalTransactionId": "bet-round-101-1"
}

### 11. Overdraft Attempt (Rule 9 Rejection: R$ 50.000,00 -> HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Provider-Id: {{providerId}}

{
  "providerId": "{{providerId}}",
  "externalTransactionId": "bet-overdraft-1",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{providerId}}:overdraft-1",
  "playerId": "player-test-01",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-overdraft",
  "gameId": "gates-of-olympus",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "50000.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### 12. Get Wallet Ledger (Auditable Immutable History)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=10

### 13. Reconcile Wallet (Zero Difference Mathematical Invariant Check)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconcile
